@main = http://localhost:5000
@worker = http://localhost:5201

### Principal
GET {{main}}/

### Verificar BCB + 14 bancos + workers habilitados
GET {{main}}/api/asfi/dependencies

### Configuración efectiva
GET {{main}}/api/asfi/config-summary

### Lanzar corrida
POST {{main}}/api/asfi/runs

### Reemplaza RUN_ID
GET {{main}}/api/asfi/runs/RUN_ID

### Resultados
GET {{main}}/api/asfi/runs/RUN_ID/results?take=100

### Worker
GET {{worker}}/api/worker/health
